    <string name="about_app_title">About Todo Planner</string>
    <string name="about_app_message">Todo Planner helps you plan your day with tasks and meetings in one place. You can create Clock-in, All-day, Duration, and Repeat tasks, add attachments (photos/files), and track everything in the Calendar.

How to use:
1. Open the Scheduler tab.
2. Choose a type:
   • Clock-in: Tap Submit to start, then Stop when done.
   • All-day: Select a date and save.
   • Duration: Choose From/To date and time, then save.
   • Repeat: Set start/end date and time, choose Every day or Custom days, then tap Done.
3. Open the Calendar tab to see your tasks and red dots on dates with tasks.
4. Tap a date to view tasks for that day.
5. Tap a task to View / Edit / Delete it, or add attachments.
6. Use the Todo tab to browse all tasks, search, and export to Excel/CSV if needed.</string>
